supralinux-settings (0.1.0~dev1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial development package for persistent SupraLINUX defaults.
  * Configure the SDDM greeter to run on KWin Wayland using KDE's Plasma
    Wayland greeter integration.
  * Keep XWayland available through the Plasma Wayland stack for legacy X11
    application compatibility; this package does not disable X11 libraries or
    compatibility components.

